4541..4607 Comment "/// The loop\'s words and the presented integers are equivalent, by"
4608..4683 Comment "/// `windWords` and `spinWords` with the two round trips at a variable (the"
4684..4760 Comment "/// book\'s Theorem 8.1.9, one stratum down). The later entries read `to` and"
4761..4836 Comment "/// `back`, so the record is their dependent pairs nested to the right, and"
4837..4913 Comment "/// its value nests the same way: `sectWords` and `retrWords` are checked at"
4914..4984 Comment "/// the types the record states once `to` is `windWords` and `back` is"
4985..5001 Comment "/// `spinWords`."
